e behaviour open, so I picked these:\n- **Paragraph breaks:** a heading, fence, `---`, block quote or list item ends a paragraph, even with no blank line before it.\n- **Lists:** items are one line each and don't nest. A list ends at the first line that isn't an item.\n- **Unclosed fence:** it runs to the end of the input.\n- **Underscores:** one next to a letter or digit stays plain text, so `snake_case_name` is unchanged. Underscores inside link URLs are left alone too.\n- **Command output:** a trailing newline is added after non-empty output, and nothing is written for blank input.\n\nThe package is in `md2html/` (`converter.py` holds the logic, `__main__.py` the command) and the tests are in `tests/test_convert.py`.","ttft_ms":23048,"type":"result","duration_ms":50938,"uuid":"54c3f14b-6945-488e-8feb-3abd7834d10a","ttft_stream_ms":1181,"time_to_request_ms":47,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":11,"system_prompt":8,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":6,"input_hooks":1,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":2,"engine_pickup":0,"autocompact":1,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":7,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":4},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":0,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":70,"time_to_request_major_faults":27,"first_content_frame_ms":1181,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
